Changes in Version 2.1.0 (2026-03-13)
=====================================

  * Added functions:
    * divMod to retrieve division quotient and remainder
    * latinSquare to calculate a latin square,
    * namedVector to vectorize a matrix whilst combining row and column names
    * rrr for reduced rank regression
    * predict.rrr to predict from rrr object

Changes in Version 2.0.0 (2025-03-19)
=====================================

  * Added functionality for cost-effectiveness analyses (CEA, CEAC, wtp).

  * Convert currency names to Unicode character or Unicode code using currency2unicode.

  * Calculate local f^2 values for (generalized) linear (mixed) models using f2Local.
